improved cold-weather charging,\\n  * Dual Voltage Charging Cable,\\n  * 77 kWh Lithium Ion Battery,\\n  * NACS Charging Port,\\n  * 17.3 kWh/100km (Combined)\\n  * Up to 468 km range on full charge\\n\\n**Off-Road;**\\n\\n  * Downhill Assist Control,\\n  * Crawl Control \\n  * Towing Capacity (3,500 lbs),\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 14\\\" Toyota Multimedia with Back-up Guidance Monitor,\\n  * 7\\\" Digital Gauge Cluster,\\n  * Auto-Dimming Rearview Mirror with Garage Door Opener,\\n  * Digital key (Requires active Remote Connect subscription),\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto\\n  * Smart key with push-button start,\\n  * Bluetooth, SiriusXM, and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n  * Rain-sensing windshield wipers,\\n  * 120V/1500-watt AC Power Outlet,\\n  * 15W Dual Wireless Charger,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Mixed SofTex and Fabric Seats,\\n  * Power Backdoor with Kick Sensor,\\n  * 8-Way Power-Adjustable Driver Seat with 2-way Lumbar Support,\\n  * Power Backdoor with Kick Sensor,\\n  * 2-Zone Automatic Climate control with A/C,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather-trimmed Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated front seats,\\n  * Heated steering wheel,\\n  * Heated Power Side Mirrors,\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3-year trial) - Charge Management, Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows\\n  * Service Connect (5 year min, 4G network dependent) - Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications.\\n  * Safety Connect (5 year min, 4G network dependent) - Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (3-year trial) Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Parking Support Brake - Object, Vehicle, Pedestrian,\\n  * Anti-Theft Alarm System,\\n  * Engine Immobilizer,\\n  * Blind Spot Monitoring with RCTA,\\n  * Safe Exit Alert,\\n  * Front and Rear Parking Assist with Automatic Braking,\\n  * Driver Monitor Camera,\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED Daytime Running Lights,\\n  * Bi-LED Projector Low-and High-Beam Headlights w/ LED Accent Lights,\\n  * LED Rear Combination Lamps\\n  * Puddle Lights,\\n  * 18\\\" Black/Silver Alloy Wheels w/Plastic Covers,\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota bZ Edmonton has to offer!\\nRugged on the outside, refined on the inside, Edmonton Toyota bZ s drivers are\\nmaking the most out of every moment. The newest bZ gives you added\\nconvenience, better comfort, and next-level technology. That\'s why this is the\\nToyota bZ Edmonton loves. It has a spacious cabin, premium materials, and tons\\nof features that make your life easier behind the wheel. To get the most out\\nof every journey, make your next cross-over the Toyota Corolla Cross,\\nEdmonton.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 26, \"date_created\": 1781654400, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [], \"stock_number\": \"26BZ2706\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 17, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": null, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 50998, \"special_price\": 50998, \"body_type_name\": \"Sport Utility\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Electric Fuel System\", \"published_trim\": \"XLE AWD; FULLY ELECTRIC!! 338 HP!! HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, BLIND SPOT, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, BACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, REMOTE + SERVICE + SAFETY + DRIVE CONNECT\", \"trim_variation\": \"XLE AWD\", \"cbb_clean_price\": null, \"cbb_rough_price\": null, \"drive_type_desc\": null, \"drive_type_name\": \"AWD\", \"is_just_arrived\": false, \"make_model_trim\": {\"lvl0\": \"Toyota\", \"lvl1\": \"Toyota > bZ\", \"lvl2\": \"Toyota > bZ > XLE\"}, \"published_notes\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #111111;\\\">TOYOTA BZ XLE AWD; FULLY ELECTRIC!! 338 HP!! HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, BLIND SPOT, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, BACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, REMOTE + SERVICE + SAFETY + DRIVE CONNECT!!!</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA;\\\">The all new 2026 bZ XLE AWD offers awe-inspiring performance without compromise. The electric powertrain boasts 3