-point seatbelt\", \"Reflector headlights\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Tire specific low air pressure warning\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"3 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE15JIwazgI\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": false, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 55998, \"model_name\": \"Tundra\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 55998, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX SR 4X4; SMART KEY, SIDE STEPS, SAFETY SENSE 2.5,\\nBACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, SAFETY/SERVICE/REMOTE/DRIVE\\nCONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThis all-new 2026 TOYOTA TUNDRA SR comes with our new 3.4L twin-turbo V6, 358\\nHP (406 lb.ft) engine paired to a smooth-shifting 10 automatic transmission;\\nGreat for towing up to 8,289 lbs. or a payload of 1,819 lbs.!!! Well equipped\\nwith features, this Tundra comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * Side steps\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Independent Front Suspension, Rear Coil Spring Suspension, \\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Smart Key System with Push Button Start,\\n  * 8\\\" Touchscreen with backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto Compatibility,\\n  * SiriusXM radio,\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Automatic Climate Control with Air Conditioning,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Windshield De-Icer & Rear Window Defogger,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC),\\n  * Motion Sensor Alarm,\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System with Auto Location (TPMS),\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS)\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect Vehicle Status (3-yr trail): Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find my vehicle, Guest Driver monitor, Status of windows.\\n  * Service Connect (5-year minimum trial): Vehicle health reports, warning light notification.\\n  * Safety Connect (5-year minimum trial): automatic collision notification, Stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (Subscription Required): Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * 5.5\' Cargo bed,\\n  * Full Resin Bed\\n  * Towing hitch,\\n  * Bi-Beam LED headlamps\\n  * 18\\\" Steel wheels,\\n\\n Buy with a brand that has a proven history of reliability and customer\\nsatisfaction. Toyota holds the Best Retained Value for Subcompact, Compact,\\nMid-size, Full-Size Car as well as Small Pickup Truck from Canadian Black\\nBook.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51