ng\", \"Rear seat cheque warning\", \"Trip computer\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Driver attention alert\", \"Traffic sign recognition\", \"Following distance alert\", \"Evasion assist system\", \"Immobilizer\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"Security system\", \"Manual tilting steering wheel\", \"Manual telescopic steering wheel\", \"Power first-row windows\", \"Power second-row windows\", \"Front and rear one-touch down windows\", \"Light tinted windows\", \"Front and rear one-touch up windows\", \"Fixed interval front windshield wipers\", \"Rear window defroster\", \"Fixed rear windshield\", \"36 month/60,000 km\", \"60 month/100,000 km\", \"60 month/unlimited\", \"36 month/unlimited\", \"15 x 6.5-inch front and rear steel wheels\", \"P195/65SR15 AS BSW front and rear tires\", \"Torsion beam rear suspension\", \"Front splash guards\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Front seat centre armrest\", \"Rear beverage holders\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust\", \"Front licence plate bracket\", \"Rear splash guards\", \"Body-coloured door mirrors\", \"Driver seat manual reclining, fore/aft control and height adjustable control\", \"Passenger seat manual reclining and fore/aft control\", \"Lock-up transmission\", \"6 speakers\", \"Driver information centre\", \"Black rear bumper rub strip\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 7.00\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Day/Night rearview mirror\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Front reading lights\", \"Variable instrument panel light\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Headlights on reminder\", \"Illuminated ignition switch\", \"Full floor coverage\", \"Trip odometer\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Automatic\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Front cross traffic warning\", \"AM/FM/satellite\", \"Wheel security locks\", \"Illuminated driver visor mirror\", \"Illuminated passenger visor mirror\", \"Heated driver and front passenger seats\", \"8 beverage holders\", \"Automatic climate control\", \"Yes\", \"Power door locks with 2 stage unlocking\", \"Smart key with hands-free access and push button start\", \"Low tire pressure warning\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"External exit warning system\", \"Leather steering wheel\", \"Heated steering wheel\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"First-row sliding and tilting glass sunroof with express open/close activation  sunshade\", \"Rear seat centre armrest\", \"Smart device remote start\", \"Push-button\", \"Independent rear suspension\", \"Rear lip spoiler\", \"Coloured bodyside insert\", \"Premium cloth front seat upholstery\", \"Metal-look door panel insert\", \"Premium cloth rear seat upholstery\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Variable intermittent front windshield wipers\", \"18 x 8-inch front and rear grey aluminum wheels\", \"P225/50VR18 AS BSW front and rear tires\", \"Multi-link rear suspension\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Sport front bucket seats\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust with chrome tailpipe finisher\", \"Body-coloured front bumper insert\", \"Black front bumper rub strip\", \"Sequential shift with steering wheel controls\", \"Driver seat with 8-way directional controls\", \"Driver seat with 2-way power lumbar\", \"Heated rear seats\", \"Cloth and leatherette front seat upholstery\", \"Leatherette front seatback upholstery\", \"Piano black and metal-look door panel insert\", \"Cloth and leatherette rear seat upholstery\", \"Cargo net\", \"Voice-activated climate control\", \"Branded speakers\", \"Amplifier\", \"Digital signal processor\", \"10.5 inch primary display\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Front wireless smart device charging\", \"Redundant digital speedometer\", \"Driver seat power reclining, lumbar support, cushion tilt, fore/aft control and height adjustable control\", \"9 speakers\", \"Built-in virtual assistant\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Over the air updates\", \"Full gauge cluster screen\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M2eSgp5OMMQ\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": false, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 33998, \"model_name\": \"Corolla\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 33998, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA COROLLA XSE; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! LEATHER, JBL, SUNROOF, SMART KEY,\\nHEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, ANDROID AUTO, APPLE CARPLAY, BLIND SPOT,\\nBACKUP CAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThe new 2026 TOYOTA COROLLA XSE comes with our more powerful 2.0L 169 HP\\nengine paired to a smooth shifting CVT (Continuously Variable Transmission;\\nwith a great 5.9 L/100km fuel economy on the highway! Well equipped with\\nfeatures, this Corolla comes with:\\n\\n\\n\\n  **Toyota Safety Sense 3.0;**\\n\\n  * Road Sign Assist (RSA),\\n  * Proactive Driving Assist (PDA),\\n  * Pre-Collision System (PCS),\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist (LTA),\\n  * Lane Departure Alert (LDA),\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control (DRCC),\\n  * Automatic High Beam (AHB),\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * JBL Premium audio\\n  * 10.5\\\" Touch screen with Safety Connect,\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital Gauge cluster \\n  * Backup camera,\\n  * Push-button start and smart key,\\n  * Qi wireless phone charger,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto,\\n  * Bluetooth, SiriusXM, and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Leather seats,\\n  * Power 8-way driver\'s seat with lumbar support,\\n  * Automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated steering wheel,\\n  * Heated seats,\\n  * Heated rear seats,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Wiper de-icer,\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3-year trial) - Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows/Moonroof.\\n  * Service Connect (up to 10-year trial) - Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications.\\n  * Safety Connect (up to 10-year trial) - Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (3-year trial) - Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Tire Pressure monitoring System (TPMS),\\n  * Blind spot monitor with Rear Cross Traffic Alert and Safe Exit Alert (SEA),\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Electric parking brake,\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * Power sunroof,\\n  * LED taillights,\\n  * Premium Bi-Beam LED headlamps,\\n  * 18\\\" Alloy wheels,\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota Corolla Edmonton has to\\noffer! Edmonton Toyota Corolla drivers will love its driver-focused interior,\\nbecause it actually makes those tough winter days and long waits on the Henday\\nenjoyable. You\'ll love the wide field of view, soft-touch controls, and next-\\ngen technology. Fun, intelligent, with great bang for your buck, you simply\\nget more out of life behind the wheel of the Toyota Corolla, Edmonton.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 14, \"date_created\": 1768435200, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [], \"stock_number\": \"26CO7168\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 170, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 2, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 33998, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"4dr Car\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"*DEMO SPECIAL* XSE; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! LEATHER, JBL, SUNROOF, SMART KEY, HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, ANDROID AUTO, APPLE CARPLAY, BLIND SPOT, BACKUP CAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE\", \"trim_variation\": \"XSE CVT\", \"cbb_clean_price\": null, \"cbb_rough_price\": null, \"drive_type_desc\": null, \"drive_type_name\": \"FWD\", \"is_just_arrived\": false, \"make_model_trim\": {\"lvl0\": \"Toyota\", \"lvl1\": \"Toyota > Corolla\", \"lvl2\": \"Toyota > Corolla > XSE\"}, \"published_notes\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #111111;\\\">TOYOTA COROLLA XSE; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! LEATHER, JBL, SUNROOF, SMART KEY, HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, ANDROID AUTO, APPLE CARPLAY, BLIND SPOT, BACKUP CAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT!!!</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-b