r springs\", \"Rigid axle rear suspension\", \"Selectable mode transmission\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Speed sensitive power steering\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust\", \"Standard ride suspension\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Transmission oil cooler\", \"Twin turbo\", \"Two-Speed Transfer Case\", \"Variable intake manifold\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"8 airbags\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto on/off headlight control\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Configurable instrumentation gauges\", \"Curtain first and second-row overhead airbags\", \"Delay interior courtesy lights\", \"Delay-off headlights\", \"Digital/analog instrumentation display\", \"Driver and passenger side knee airbag\", \"Driver attention alert\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front and rear parking sensors\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Hands-on cruise control\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED cab mounted cargo light\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED front fog lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Manual-levelling headlights\", \"Multiple enclosed headlights\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Predictive brake assist system\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Reflector headlights\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Tire specific low air pressure warning\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"5 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": null, \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": false, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 64497, \"model_name\": \"Tundra\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 64497, \"stock_type\": \"USED\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX LIMITED  NIGHTSHADE 4X4; LEATHER, PANORAMIC SUNROOF,\\nHEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SMART KEY, SAFETY SENSE 2.5, BACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY,\\nANDROID AUTO, DRIVE/SAFETY/SERVICE/REMOTE CONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThis 2025 TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX LIMITED NIGHTSHADE comes with our new 3.5L\\ntwin-turbo V6, 389 HP (479 lb.ft) engine paired to a smooth-shifting 10\\nautomatic transmission; Great for towing up to 11,122 lbs. or a payload of\\n1,742 lbs.!!! Well equipped with features, this Tundra comes with:\\n\\nThe CREWMAX LIMITED NIGHTSHADE adds the following features to the Crewmax SR5:\\n\\n  * Leather seats,\\n  * Panoramic Sunroof,\\n  * 14\\\" HD Touch-Screen,\\n  * Qi Wireless Charging,\\n  * Drive Connect - Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant\\n  * Blind Spot Monitor w/Rear Cross-Traffic Alert & Braking,\\n  * Intuitive Parking Assist with Auto Braking,\\n  * 20\\\" Aluminum Alloy Wheels,\\n  * Electrochromic Rear View Mirror with HomeLink,\\n  * 120 Volt (400 Watt) Cargo Bed AC Power Outlet, \\n  * Black Grille, Over fender, Rear Bumper\\n  * Semi black badges, Chrome Limited Badge\\n  * Gloss Black Belt Molding, Exterior door handles, Tailgate handle,\\n  * Power Tailgate\\n\\nIt also comes with the following features from the CREWMAX SR5\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System with Risk Avoidance Emergency Steering Assist,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Road Sign Assist,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Trailer Brakes,\\n  * Independent Front Suspension, Rear Coil Spring Suspension, \\n  * One-touch 4WD with electronically controlled transfer case,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Smart Key System with Push Button Start,\\n  * Backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto Compatibility,\\n  * SiriusXM radio,\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/AUX/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Power 8-Way Adjustable front Seats with 2-Way Lumbar,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated Front Seats,\\n  * Heated Leather-Wrapped Steering Wheel,\\n  * Dual Zone Automatic Climate Control with Air Conditioning,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Windshield De-Icer & Rear Window Defogger,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC),\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System with Auto Location (TPMS),\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS)\\n\\n**Safety/Service/Remote/Drive Connect (Subscription Required);**\\n\\n  * Safety Connect - Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance \\n  * Service Connect - vehicle health reports, warning light notification, maintena