ngine oil cooler\", \"Four channel ABS brakes\", \"Four-wheel drive\", \"Front and rear ventilated disk brakes\", \"Front anti-roll bar\", \"Front coil springs\", \"Front mounted engine\", \"HEV (hybrid electric vehicle)\", \"Hybrid\", \"Hybrid electric motor alternator\", \"Hybrid electric motor starter\", \"Independent front suspension\", \"Independent rear suspension\", \"Intercooled turbo\", \"Lead acid battery\", \"Lock-up transmission\", \"Longitudinal mounted engine\", \"Multi-link rear suspension\", \"Nickel metal hydride (NiMH)\", \"Overdrive transmission\", \"Rack-pinion steering\", \"Radiator\", \"Rear coil springs\", \"Regenerative brakes\", \"Regular Unleaded\", \"Regular grade rear springs\", \"Selectable mode transmission\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Speed sensitive power steering\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust with chrome tailpipe finisher\", \"Standard ride suspension\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Two-Speed Transfer Case\", \"Variable intake manifold\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"8 airbags\", \"Aerial view camera\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto on/off headlight control\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Configurable instrumentation gauges\", \"Curtain first and second-row overhead airbags\", \"Digital/analog instrumentation display\", \"Driver and passenger side knee airbag\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Evasion assist system\", \"External acoustic pedestrian alert\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Following distance alert\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front and rear parking sensors\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front mounted camera\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Hands-on cruise control\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED cab mounted cargo light\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED front fog lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Left side camera\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Manual-levelling headlights\", \"Multiple enclosed headlights\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Predictive brake assist system\", \"Projector beam headlights\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Right side camera\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Tire specific low air pressure warning\", \"Traffic sign recognition\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"Video-feed rearview mirror\", \"6 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vb4av46YDv4\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 83985, \"model_name\": \"Tacoma\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 83985, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA TACOMA DOUBLE CAB HYBRID TRD PRO SB;** **SHOWROOM SPECIAL!!**\\n**LEATHER, HUD, FOX SHOCK, VENTILATED/HEATED SEATS, SUNROOF, JBL, DIGITAL KEY,\\nSAFETY SENSE 3.0, SMART KEY, 4X4, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO,\\nREMOTE/SERVICE/SAFETY/DRIVE CONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThe all-new redesigned 2026 TOYOTA TACOMA HYBRID TRD PRO comes with our\\ni-FORCE MAX 2.4L Turbo Hybrid 326 hp and 465 lb.-ft of torque engine paired to\\na smooth 8 speed automatic transmission; Great for a payload of 1,631 lbs. or\\nup to 5,950 lbs. towing!!! Well equipped with features, this Tacoma comes\\nwith:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * TRD PRO TAILGATE INSERT BADGE SILVER AND RED\\n\\n**The TACOMA TRD PRO adds the following features to the TACOMA TRD Off Road\\nPremium:**\\n\\n  * *         Aux Auxiliary Switches (95A total),\\n  * *         Red Front Recovery Hooks,\\n  * *        Power Tailgate & Bump Switch,\\n  * *        Digital Interior Rear View Mirror, \\n  * *        Head Up Display (HUD),\\n  * *        18\\\" TRD Pro Alloy Wheels,\\n  * *        Goodyear Territory RT Tires,\\n  * *        IsoDynamic Performance Front Seats (6-way Power Adjustments and 2-Way Manual Recline),\\n  * *        FOX Shock Absorbers with Quick Switch 3 (3 manually selectable damping settings),\\n  * *        TOYOTA Heritage Front Grille with LED light bar,\\n  * *        Rigid LED Fog Lamps,\\n  * *        TRD Performance Air Intake & Exhaust,\\n  * *        Aluminum Front Skid Plate,\\n  * *        Rocker Protector,\\n  * *        ARB Steel Rear Bumper with 2 Red Recovery Hooks,\\n\\nIt also comes with the following features from the TACOMA TRD Off Road\\nPremium:\\n\\n\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 3.0;**\\n\\n  * *         Road Sign Assist (RSA),\\n  * *         Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * *         Pre-Collision System (PCS),\\n  * *         Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * *         Lane Tracing Assist (LTA),\\n  * *         Lane Departure Alert (LDA),\\n  * *         Full-Speed Range Dynamic Radar Cruise Control,\\n  * *         Automatic High Beam (AHB) **,**\\n\\n**Off-Road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Stabilizer with Disconnection Mechanism (SDM)\\n  * Trailer Brake Controller,\\n  * Locking Rear Differential,\\n  * Downhill Assist, Crawl Control,\\n  * Part-time 4WD, \\n  * Multi Terrain Select,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Full Digital Gauges,\\n  * Motion Sensor Alarm,\\n  * 14\\\" Touchscreen with backup camera,\\n  * JBL Premium Audio System with Portable Speaker,\\n  * Smart key with push-button start,\\n  * Trailer Backup Guide with Straight Path Assist,\\n  * Digital Key,\\n  * 2400w AC outlet,\\n  * Wireless Charger, \\n  * Garage Door Opener,,\\n  * Wireless Android Auto and Apple CarPlay,\\n  * Dual Bluetooth pairing,\\n  * SiriusXM, and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n  * 4 USB TYPE-C charging ports (2 Front; 2 Rear),\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Leather Seats,\\n  * Leather wrapped steering wheel,\\n  * Front Side Acoustic Glass,\\n  * Dual Zone Auto A/C,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n  * Auxiliary Switches,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated & Ventilated Front Seats,\\n  * Sunroof,\\n  * Heated Steering Wheel,\\n  * Front Windshield Deicer,  \\n  \\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3-year trial) Includes: Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows/Moonroof.\\n  * Service Connect (Up to10-year trial) Includes: Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications.\\n  * Safety Connect (Up to10-year trial) Includes: Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance\\n  * Drive Connect (3-year trial) Includes: Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Blind Spot Monitor with RCTA,\\n  * Parking Support Brake,\\n  * Engine Immobilizer Antitheft system,\\n  * Driver and Front Passenger Knee Airbags,\\n  * Dual Stage Driver & Passenger Airbag Supplemental Restraint System (SRS),\\n  * Front Seat (Cushion, Side, Curtain) Airbags, \\n  * Roll-Sensing Front Head/Side Curtain Airbags,\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Electric Parking Brake (EPB),\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System with Auto Location,\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC),\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * Active Grille Shutters,\\n  * 5\' Cargo bed,\\n\\nWhy keep searching for your next truck when you\'ve already found the best\\nbang-for-your-buck 2026 Toyota Tacoma Edmonton has to offer? It\'s powerful,\\ncapable, and perfect for adventure-seekers. Edmonton Toyota Tacoma drivers now\\nhave the perfect truck to hit the road ... or the off-road. Choose from\\navailable Double Cab models, then raise your game with Toyota Tacoma,\\nEdmonton, by adding one of nine available packages including TRD Sport\\nPremium, TRD Off Road Premium and TRD Pro. If you\'re looking for a Toyota\\nTacoma for sale in Edmonton that\'s a clear reflection of its trail-conquering\\nabilities, this is it.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n** **\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 0, \"date_created\": 1782086400, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"T\", \"W\"], \"stock_number\": \"26TY4791\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 12, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 2.4, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 83985, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"Double Cab\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"