de rear springs\", \"Selectable mode transmission\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust\", \"Standard ride suspension\", \"Strut front suspension\", \"Thermal coolant storage system\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Transverse mounted engine\", \"10 airbags\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto on/off headlight control\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Automatic post-collision braking system\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Brake assist system\", \"Configurable instrumentation gauges\", \"Curtain first and second-row overhead airbags\", \"Delay-off headlights\", \"Digital/analog instrumentation display\", \"Driver attention alert\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Driver side knee airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Evasion assist system\", \"External acoustic pedestrian alert\", \"External exit warning system\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Following distance alert\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front passenger seat cushion airbag\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 7.00\", \"Hands-on cruise control\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Illuminated ignition switch\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Low tire pressure warning\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Projector beam headlights\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Rear side impact airbags\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Tire mobility kit\", \"Traffic sign recognition\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"4 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Pre-wiring for turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Selective service internet access\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M2eSgp5OMMQ\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 35998, \"model_name\": \"Corolla\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 35998, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA COROLLA HYBRID LE AWD; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY\\nSENSE 3.0 ANDROID AUTO, APPLE CARPLAY, SMART KEY, BLIND SPOT MONITOR, BACKUP\\nCAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThe new 2026 TOYOTA COROLLA HYBRID LE AWD comes with our 1.8L 138 HP paired to\\nour Hybrid Synergy Drive and smooth shifting CVT (Continuously Variable\\nTransmission); with an incredible 4.9 L/100km combined fuel economy! Well\\nequipped with features, this Corolla Hybrid AWD comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * TOTT+ Package,\\n\\n  **Toyota Safety Sense 3.0;**\\n\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Lane Departure Alert,\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control,\\n  * Automatic High Beam,\\n  * Road Sign Assist,\\n  * Proactive Driving Assist,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 8\\\" Touch screen with backup camera,\\n  * 7\\\" Digital Gauge Cluster,\\n  * Smart key with push-button start,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto,\\n  * Bluetooth, SiriusXM, and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated seats,\\n  * Heated steering wheel,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Wiper de-icer,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Tire Pressure monitoring system (TPMS),\\n  * Engine Immobilizer, \\n  * Blind spot monitor with Rear Cross Traffic Alert and Safe Exit Alert,\\n  * Electric parking brake,\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect Vehicle Status (3-yr trail): Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find my vehicle, Guest Driver monitor, Status of windows.\\n  * Service Connect (5-year minimum trial): Vehicle health reports, warning light notification.\\n  * Safety Connect (5-year minimum trial): automatic collision notification, Stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (Subscription Required): Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED taillights,\\n  * Premium Bi-LED headlamps,\\n  * 15\\\" Alloy wheels,\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota Corolla Edmonton has to\\noffer! Edmonton Toyota Corolla drivers will love its driver-focused interior,\\nbecause it actually makes those tough winter days and long waits on the Henday\\nenjoyable. You\'ll love the wide field of view, soft-touch controls, and next-\\ngen technology. Fun, intelligent, with great bang for your buck, you simply\\nget more out of life behind the wheel of the Toyota Corolla, Edmonton.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 25, \"date_created\": 1781136000, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"A\", \"B\"], \"stock_number\": \"26CY6970\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 23, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 1.8, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 35998, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"4dr Car\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"HYBRID LE AWD; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY SENSE 3.0 ANDROID AUTO, APPLE CARPLAY, SMART KEY, BLIND SPOT MONITOR, BACKUP CAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT\", \"trim_variation\": \"Hybrid LE CVT AWD\", \"cbb_clean_price\": null, \"cbb_rough_price\": null, \"drive_type_desc\": null, \"drive_type_name\": \"AWD\", \"is_just_arrived\": false, \"make_model_trim\": {\"lvl0\": \"Toyota\", \"lvl1\": \"Toyota > Corolla\", \"lvl2\": \"Toyota > Corolla > Hybrid LE\"}, \"published_notes\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #111111;\\\">TOYOTA COROLLA HYBRID LE AWD; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! HEA