 \"5 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE15JIwazgI\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 83089, \"model_name\": \"Tundra\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 83089, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX 1794 4X4; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! HUD, JBL, LEATHER,\\nPANORAMIC SUNROOF, HEATED/COOLED SEATS, SMART KEY, SAFETY SENSE 2.5, BACKUP\\nCAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, DRIVE/SAFETY/SERVICE/REMOTE CONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThis all-new 2026 TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX 1794 **** comes with our new 3.4L\\ntwin-turbo V6, 389 HP (479 lb.ft) engine paired to a smooth-shifting 10\\nautomatic transmission; Great for towing up to 11,122 lbs. or a payload of\\n1,664 lbs.!!! Well equipped with features, this Tundra comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * HARD TRI FOLD TONNEAU COVER\\n\\nThe CREWMAX 1794 adds the following features to the CREWMAX PLATINUM:\\n\\n  * Saddle Tan Leather\\n  * Authentic Wood Trim\\n  * 1794 Stamped tailgate,\\n  * 20\\\" alloy rims,\\n\\nIt also comes with the following features from the CREWMAX PLATINUM\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Trailer Brakes,\\n  * Trailer Backup Guide with Straight Path Assist,\\n  * Active Noise Control,\\n  * Indepe