emory control\", \"Primary monitor touchscreen\", \"Radio data system (RDS)\", \"Seek scan\", \"Voice activated audio controls\", \"Window grid audio antenna\", \"Wireless audio streaming\", \"36 month/60,000 km\", \"36 month/unlimited\", \"60 month/100,000 km\", \"60 month/unlimited\", \"4L V-6 DOHC\", \"4L V-6 DOHC, variable valve control, regular unleaded, engine with 270HP\", \"5-speed automatic\", \"All-speed ABS and driveline traction control\", \"Alternator\", \"Aluminum cylinder head\", \"Aluminum engine block\", \"Auto locking hub control\", \"Automatic\", \"Double wishbone front suspension\", \"Engine oil cooler\", \"Four channel ABS brakes\", \"Four-wheel drive\", \"Front and rear ventilated disk brakes\", \"Front coil springs\", \"Front mounted engine\", \"Hydraulic power-assist steering system\", \"ICE\", \"Independent front suspension\", \"Lead acid battery\", \"Lock-up transmission\", \"Longitudinal mounted engine\", \"Multi-link rear suspension\", \"Overdrive transmission\", \"Rack-pinion steering\", \"Radiator\", \"Rear coil springs\", \"Regular Unleaded\", \"Regular grade rear springs\", \"Rigid axle rear suspension\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Speed sensitive power steering\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Transmission oil cooler\", \"V6\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4 door entry light(s)\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"8 airbags\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Analog instrumentation display\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto off headlight control\", \"Brake assist system\", \"Daytime running lights\", \"Driver and passenger side knee airbag\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Forward collision mitigation\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill descent control\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Illuminated ignition switch\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED front fog lights\", \"LED low beam headlights\", \"Lane departure warning\", \"Low tire pressure warning\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Multiple enclosed headlights\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Projector beam headlights\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"3 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Smart device mirroring\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": null, \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": false, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 44497, \"model_name\": \"4Runner\", \"passengers\": 7, \"sort_price\": 44497, \"stock_type\": \"USED\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA 4RUNNER LIMITED; LEATHER, JBL, 3M, SUNROOF, NAV, HEATED/COOLED SEATS,\\nSMART, KEY, BACKUP CAMERA, SAFETY/SERVICE CONNECT, ANDROID/APPLE CONNECT, 7\\nPASSENGER!!!**\\n\\nThis 2021 TOYOTA 4RUNNER LIMITED 7 PASSENGER comes with our 4.0 L 270 HP\\nengine paired to a smooth-shifting 5-speed automatic transmission. An\\nauthentic off-road Sport Utility Vehicle, the 4Runner combines heavy-duty\\nbody-on-frame construction with a powerful exterior design. Very well equipped\\nthis 4Runner comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * 3M protection film\\n\\n**Safety Sense-P;**\\n\\n  * Pre-Collision System w/Pedestrian Detection,\\n  * Lane Departure Alert,\\n  * Automatic High Beam,\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control (High Speed),\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Android Auto and Apple CarPlay,\\n  * 120V 400W power plug,\\n  * Smart key with push-button start,\\n  * Navigation,\\n  * 8\\\" Touchscreen with backup camera,\\n  * JBL premium 15 speaker sound system,\\n  * SiriusXM, Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB/CD stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Leather seats with 3rd row (7 Passenger), \\n  * Front ventilated seats,\\n  * Dual-zone automatic climate control with A/C and cabin filter,\\n  * 8 Way memory power driver\'s seat,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Auto-dimming rear-view mirror,\\n  * Leather multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n  **Off-Road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Full-time 4WD system,\\n  * X-REAS Sport suspension,\\n  * Fuel tank and transfer case protector plates,\\n  * Trailer hitch with 4/7-pin trailer wire harness,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated seats,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Windshield wiper de-icer,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Anti-theft system\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS)\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety Connect (Subscription Required);**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect - car starter, find my vehicle, guest vehicle monitor, window status,\\n  * Service Connect - vehicle health reports, warning light notification, maintenance schedule,\\n  * Safety connect - auto collision notification, stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance,\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * Power sunroof,\\n  * Running boards,\\n  * LED fog lamps,\\n  * LED headlights,\\n  * 20\\\" Aluminum Alloy wheels,\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Sales Team\\nat 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca, or come on\\nin!**\\n\\n**Toyota on the Trail is Edmonton \'s NEWEST Toyota dealer - Located on your\\nway at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can\'t miss us! Toyota\\non the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\nLooking for a used Toyota in Edmonton? Look no further than Edmonton\'s used\\nToyota leader: Go Auto and Toyota on the Trail. No matter the style, we have\\nthe used Toyota Edmonton drivers are looking for. From the RAV4 to the Corolla\\nto the Tundra to the Tacoma to the Highlander, no matter which used Toyota\\nEdmonton drivers are looking for, we have it. Plus, you get more for what you\\npay for at Toyota on the Trail! Your used Toyota in Edmonton comes with a free\\nGo Card that will save you 10% on all parts and service, a $500 bonus payout\\nevery time you refer a purchasing customer, and much more. So if you\'re\\nlooking for a used Toyota in Edmonton, look no further than Toyota on the\\nTrail.\\n\\n**This vehicle may be leased or financed by anyone*, however, due to the\\nrecent increase in fraudulent vehicle purchase activity, Toyota on the Trail\\nreserves the right to decline a transaction on suspicion of non-retail\\nintentions including but not limited to wholesaling or exporting.**  \\n\\n * **On approved credit, see dealer for details**  \\n\\nDISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed here.\\nDue to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee the\\naccuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable attempts\\nbeing made to ensure its accuracy.\\n\\nAMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n**AB Regulations Section 31.1(1):  NO DISCLOSURES  ******\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 28, \"date_created\": 1777248000, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": true, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"STDEN\", \"08S6\", \"STDTN\", \"STDAX\", \"STDGV\", \"STDTR\", \"STDWL\", \"STDST\", \"STDTM\", \"STDSU\", \"STDRD\", \"AIRBG\", \"FLBBZL\", \"MIRR\", \"E\", \"M\"], \"stock_number\": \"26TH5876A\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 68, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engi