display\", \"Driver and passenger side knee airbag\", \"Driver attention alert\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front and rear parking sensors\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Hands-on cruise control\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED cab mounted cargo light\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED front fog lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Manual-levelling headlights\", \"Multiple enclosed headlights\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Predictive brake assist system\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Reflector headlights\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Tire specific low air pressure warning\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"5 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE15JIwazgI\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 71878, \"model_name\": \"Tundra\", \"passengers\": null, \"sort_price\": 71878, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX LIMITED NIGHTSHADE LONG BOX 4X4; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!!\\nLEATHER, PANORAMIC SUNROOF, HEATED/COOLED SEATS, SMART KEY, SAFETY SENSE 2.5,\\nBACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, DRIVE/SAFETY/SERVICE/REMOTE\\nCONNECT!!!**\\n\\nThis all-new 2026 TOYOTA TUNDRA CREWMAX LIMITED NIGHTSHADE LONG BOX comes with\\nour new 3.4L twin-turbo V6, 389 HP (479 lb.ft) engine paired to a smooth-\\nshifting 10 automatic transmission; Great for towing up to 10,968 lbs. or a\\npayload of 1,642 lbs.!!! Well equipped with features, this Tundra comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * DUAL STEP RUNNING BOARDS\\n\\nThe CREWMAX LIMITED NIGHTSHADE adds the following features to the Crewmax SR5:\\n\\n  * Leather seats,\\n  * Ventilated front seats,\\n  * Panoramic Sunroof,\\n  * 14\\\" Touch-Screen,\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital Gauge cluster,\\n  * Wireless Charger,\\n  * Blind Spot Monitor w/Rear Cross-Traffic Alert,\\n  * Intuitive Parking Assist with Auto Braking,\\n  * 20\\\" Black Alloy Wheels,\\n  * Auto-dimming Rear View Mirror,\\n  * 120 Volt (400 Watt) Cargo Bed AC Power Outlet,\\n  * Black Grille, Over fender, Rear Bumper\\n  * Gloss Black Belt Molding, Exterior door handles, Tailgate handle,\\n  * Power Tailgate\\n\\nIt also comes with the following features from the CREWMAX SR5\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Trailer Brakes,\\n  * Independent Front Suspension, Rear Coil Spring Suspension, \\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Smart Key System with Push Button Start,\\n  * Backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto Compatibility,\\n  * SiriusXM radio,\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Power 8-Way Adjustable front Seats with 2-Way Lumbar,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated Front Seats,\\n  * Heated Leather-Wrapped Steering Wheel,\\n  * Dual Zone Automatic Climate Control with Air Conditioning,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Windshield De-Icer & Rear Window Defogger,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC),\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Motion Sensor Alarm,\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System with Auto Location (TPMS),\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS)\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect Vehicle Status (3-yr trial): Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find my vehicle, Guest Driver monitor, Status of windows.\\n  * Service Connect (5-year minimum trial): Vehicle health reports, warning light notification.\\n  * Safety Connect (5-year minimum trial): automatic collision notification, Stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (3-yr trial): Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED Fog Lamps,\\n  * 6.5\' Cargo bed,\\n  * Full Resin Bed\\n  * Trailer breaks,\\n  * Towing hitch,\\n  * Bi-Beam LED headlamps\\n\\n Buy with a brand that has a proven history of reliability and customer\\nsatisfaction. Toyota holds the Best Retained Value for Subcompact, Compact,\\nMid-size, Full-Size Car as well as Small Pickup Truck from Canadian Black\\nBook.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n\\n\\n*Vehicle may not appear exactly as shown\\n\\n** **\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 22, \"date_created\": 1782086400, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"A\", \"B\"], \"stock_number\": \"26TU9716\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 12, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 3.4, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 71878, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"Standard Bed\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"NIGHTSHADE LONG BOX 4X4;  SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! LEATHER, PANORAMIC SUNROOF, HEATED/COOLED SEATS, SMART KEY, SAFETY SENSE 2.5, BACKUP CAMERA, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO, DRIVE/SAFETY/SERVICE/REMOTE CONNE\", \"trim_variation\": \"4x4 Crewmax Limited Long Bed\", \"cbb_clean_price\": null, \"cbb_rough_price\": null, \"drive_type_desc\": null, \"drive_type_name\": \"4WD\", \"is_just_arrived\": false, \"make_model_trim\": {\"lvl0\": \"Toyota\", \"lvl1\": \"Toyota > Tundra\", \"lvl2\": \"Toyota > Tundra > Limited\"}, \"published_notes\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14.0pt