transmission\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Speed sensitive power steering\", \"Sport ride suspension\", \"Stainless steel quasi-dual exhaust with black tailpipe finisher\", \"Strut front suspension\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Transmission oil cooler\", \"Transverse mounted engine\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"8 airbags\", \"Aerial view camera\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto on/off headlight control\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Configurable instrumentation gauges\", \"Curtain first and second-row overhead airbags\", \"Delay-off headlights\", \"Digital instrumentation display\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Driver side knee airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Evasion assist system\", \"External acoustic pedestrian alert\", \"External exit warning system\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Following distance alert\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front and rear parking sensors\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front mounted camera\", \"Front passenger seat cushion airbag\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill descent control\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Illuminated ignition switch\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED front fog lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Left side camera\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Predictive brake assist system\", \"Projector beam headlights\", \"Rain detecting wipers\", \"Rear collision mitigation\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Remote activated perimeter approach lighting with puddle lights\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Right side camera\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Security system\", \"Traffic sign recognition\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"5 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Mobile hotspot internet access\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZO3K68LcYY\", \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 61998, \"model_name\": \"RAV4\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 61998, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA RAV4 XSE AWD HYBRID; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! SUNROOF, LEATHER, DIGITAL\\nKEY, SAFETY SENSE 4.0, HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, BACKUP CAMERA,\\nREMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT, APPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO!!!**\\n\\nThe completely redesigned 2026 Toyota RAV4 Hybrid XSE AWD features Toyota\'s\\nrevolutionary 5th-generation hybrid system. Powered by a new 2.5L drivetrain,\\nit delivers a smooth and confident 236 horsepower through an eCVT to all four\\nwheels, while achieving an impressive 5.8 L/100 km combined fuel economy.\\nExceptionally well equipped, this RAV4 Hybrid includes::\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * TOTT+ Upgrade Package,\\n  * Cross Bars,\\n  * Illuminated Door sill protector,\\n\\n**The XSE adds the following features to the XLE:**\\n\\n  * 20\\\" Black Alloy Wheels,\\n  * 12.9\\\" Toyota Multimedia,\\n  * 9 Speaker JBL Audio System,\\n  * SofTex Seats w/ Blue Stitching,\\n  * 8-way Power Adjustable Passenger Seats,\\n  * Driver\'s Seat Memory System,\\n  * Front Ventilated Seats,\\n  * Auto-Dimming Rearview Mirror W/ Garage Door Opener,\\n  * Panoramic View Monitor,\\n  * Vertical LED Accent Lights,\\n  * Power Slide / Tilt Moonroof,\\n  * Anti-Theft Alarm System,\\n\\n**It also comes with the following features from the XLE:**\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 4.0;**\\n\\n  * Automatic High Beam (AHB),\\n  * Road Sign Assist (RSA),\\n  * Proactive Driving Assist (PDA),\\n  * Pre-Collision System (PCS),\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist (LTA),\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control (DRCC),\\n  * Lane Departure Alert (LDA)\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital cluster,\\n  * Smart key system with push button start,\\n  * Wireless Phone Charger,\\n  * Digital Key 2.0,\\n  * Rain Sensing Wipers\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto,\\n  * 5G Connectivity with OTA Updates,\\n  * Sirius XM 360L (Satellite + Streaming content),\\n  * Dual Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * SofTex Seats,\\n  * Dual-zone automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Power Back Door,\\n  * 8-Way Power Driver Seat with Lumbar Support,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather Trimmed Shift Knob,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated front seats,\\n  * Heated Steering Wheel,\\n  * Windshield wiper deicer,\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3 Year trial) - Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows.\\n  * Service Connect (Minimum 5-year trial) - Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications, \\n  * Safety Connect (Minimum 5-year trial) - Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance,\\n  * Drive Connect (3 Year trial) - Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant \\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Intelligent Clearance Sonar,\\n  * Engine immobilizer,\\n  * Blindspot monitor with rear cross-traffic alert and safe exit alert,\\n  * Emergency Driving Stop System (EDSS),\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED Rear Combination Lamps,\\n  * LED Projector Low-and High-Beam Headlamps,\\n  * LED Daytime Running Lights (DRL),\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota RAV4 Hybrid Edmonton has to\\noffer! Rugged on the outside, refined on the inside, and trail tough\\nthroughout, Edmonton Toyota RAV4 Hybrid drivers are making the most out of\\nevery moment. The newest RAV4 Hybrid gives you added convenience, better\\ncomfort, next-level technology, and multi-terrain select. That\'s why this is\\nthe Toyota RAV4 Hybrid Edmonton loves. It has a spacious cabin, premium\\nmaterials, and tons of features that make your life easier behind the wheel.\\nTo get the most out of every journey, make your next SUV the Toyota RAV4,\\nEdmonton.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n** ** AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 14, \"date_created\": 1781654400, \"dealer_phone\": \"