Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Trailer Brakes,\\n  * Independent Front Suspension, Rear Coil Spring Suspension, \\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Smart Key System with Push Button Start,\\n  * Backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto Compatibility,\\n  * SiriusXM radio,\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Power 8-Way Adjustable front Seats with 2-Way Lumbar,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated Front Seats,\\n  * Heated Leather-Wrapped Steering Wheel,\\n  * Dual Zone Automatic Climate Control with Air Conditioning,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Windshield De-Icer & Rear Window Defogger,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC),\\n  * 8 Airbags,\\n  * Motion Sensor Alarm,\\n  * Tire Pressure Monitoring System with Auto Location (TPMS),\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS)\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect Vehicle Status (3-yr trial): Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find my vehicle, Guest Driver monitor, Status of windows.\\n  * Service Connect (5-year minimum trial): Vehicle health reports, warning light notification.\\n  * Safety Connect (5-year minimum trial): automatic collision notification, Stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (3-yr trial): Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED Fog Lamps,\\n  * 5.5\' Cargo bed,\\n  * Full Resin Bed\\n  * Trailer breaks,\\n  * Towing hitch,\\n  * Bi-Beam LED headlamps\\n\\n Buy with a brand that has a proven history of reliability and customer\\nsatisfaction. Toyota holds the Best Retained Value for Subcompact, Compact,\\nMid-size, Full-Size Car as well as Small Pickup Truck from Canadian Black\\nBook.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n\\n\\n*Vehicle may not appear exactly as shown\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 20, \"date_created\": 1780272000, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"A\", \"M\"], \"stock_number\": \"26TU1379\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 33, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 3.4, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 69998, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"Short Bed\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"*ON GROUND* LIMITED NIGHTSHADE 4X