\\n  * Carbon fiber roof,\\n  * Rear Spoiler,\\n  * Sub-radiator,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 8-Speaker JBL premium audio,\\n  * Head-up Display,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated Steering wheel,\\n\\n**Included Features from the CORE:**\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 3.0;**\\n\\n  * Road Sign Assist,\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane tracing assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n\\n**Performance;**\\n\\n  * Brake Cooling Ducts,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital Gauge Cluster,\\n  * 6-Speed Manual with rev matching,\\n  * Pushbutton start with Smart Key system\\n  * 8\\\" Touchscreen with backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Android Auto and Apple CarPlay\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated front seats,\\n  * Windshield de-icer,\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3-year trial) Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows/Moonroof.\\n  * Service Connect (up to 10-year trial)- Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications.\\n  * Safety Connect (up to 10-year trial) Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (3-year trial) Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Blind Spot Monitoring System with Safe Exit Alert,\\n  * 10 Airbags,\\n  * Engine Immobilizer vehicle anti-theft system,\\n  * Hill-start Assist Control (HAC) \\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED headlights,\\n  * Fog Lamps,\\n  * LED rear lamps,\\n\\nBuy with a brand that has a proven history of reliability and customer\\nsatisfaction. Toyota holds the Best Retained Value for Subcompact, Compact,\\nMid-size, Full-size Car as well as Small Pickup Truck from Canadian Black\\nBook.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 0, \"date_created\": 1780272000, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"B\", \"B\"], \"stock_number\": \"26CG1034\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 33, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 1.6, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 65998, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"Hatchback\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"PREMIUM MT; 300HP! AWD, SAFETY SENSE 3.0, HUD, HEATED SEATS, BACKUP CAMERA, SMART KEY, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT\", \"trim_variation\": \"Manual\", \"cbb_clean_price\": null, \"cbb_rough_price\": null, \"drive_type_desc\": null, \"drive_type_name\": \"AWD\", \"is_just_arrived\": false, \"make_model_trim\": {\"lvl0\": \"Toyota\", \"lvl1\": \"Toyota > GR Corolla\", \"lvl2\": \"Toyota > GR Corolla > Manual\"}, \"published_notes\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size