ped with features, this Corolla Hybrid AWD comes with:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * TOTT+ Package,\\n\\n  **Toyota Safety Sense 3.0;**\\n\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Lane Departure Alert,\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control,\\n  * Automatic High Beam,\\n  * Road Sign Assist,\\n  * Proactive Driving Assist,\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * 8\\\" Touch screen with backup camera,\\n  * 7\\\" Digital Gauge Cluster,\\n  * Smart key with push-button start,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto,\\n  * Bluetooth, SiriusXM, and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated seats,\\n  * Heated steering wheel,\\n  * Heated mirrors,\\n  * Wiper de-icer,\\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Tire Pressure monitoring system (TPMS),\\n  * Engine Immobilizer, \\n  * Blind spot monitor with Rear Cross Traffic Alert and Safe Exit Alert,\\n  * Electric parking brake,\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist (BA), \\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect Vehicle Status (3-yr trail): Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find my vehicle, Guest Driver monitor, Status of windows.\\n  * Service Connect (5-year minimum trial): Vehicle health reports, warning light notification.\\n  * Safety Connect (5-year minimum trial): automatic collision notification, Stolen vehicle locator, emergency assistance button, enhanced roadside assistance.\\n  * Drive Connect (Subscription Required): Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant.\\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * LED taillights,\\n  * Premium Bi-LED headlamps,\\n  * 15\\\" Alloy wheels,\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota Corolla Edmonton has to\\noffer! Edmonton Toyota Corolla drivers will love its driver-focused interior,\\nbecause it actually makes those tough winter days and long waits on the Henday\\nenjoyable. You\'ll love the wide field of view, soft-touch controls, and next-\\ngen technology. Fun, intelligent, with great bang for your buck, you simply\\nget more out of life behind the wheel of the Toyota Corolla, Edmonton.\\n\\n**Interested in this vehicle and need more information? Contact our Internet\\nSales Team at 780.702.2222, toyotaonthetrailsalesleads@toyotaonthetrail.ca or\\ncome on in!**\\n\\n**Located at the corner of 51st Avenue and Calgary Trail, you can \'t miss us!\\nToyota on the Trail is an AMVIC-Licensed Business.**\\n\\n**       **AMVIC Licensed Business\\n\\n****Price includes all fees and delivery and destination charge****\\n\\n**DISCLAIMER: Please contact us for verification of any information listed\\nhere. Due to human error and other possible complications, we cannot guarantee\\nthe accuracy of the information included herein, despite all reasonable\\nattempts being made to ensure its accuracy.**\\n\\n\", \"is_featured\": false, \"photo_count\": 25, \"date_created\": 1781136000, \"dealer_phone\": \"780-702-2222\", \"is_certified\": false, \"is_demo_unit\": false, \"option_codes\": [\"A\", \"B\"], \"stock_number\": \"26CY6970\", \"vehicle_type\": \"passenger\", \"date_modified\": 1783123200, \"days_in_stock\": 23, \"dealer_region\": \"Edmonton Area\", \"engine_litres\": 1.8, \"is_on_special\": false, \"regular_price\": 35998, \"special_price\": null, \"body_type_name\": \"4dr Car\", \"craft_site_ids\": [1, 21, 38], \"date_inservice\": null, \"dealer_address\": \"5210 Calgary Trail NW\", \"dealer_country\": \"Canada\", \"decode_version\": 2, \"fuel_type_name\": \"Gasoline Fuel\", \"published_trim\": \"HYBRID LE AWD; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, SAFETY SENSE 3.0 