cludes;**\\n\\n  * HARD TRI FOLD TONNEAU COVER\\n\\nThe CREWMAX 1794 adds the following features to the CREWMAX PLATINUM:\\n\\n  * Saddle Tan Leather\\n  * Authentic Wood Trim\\n  * 1794 Stamped tailgate,\\n  * 20\\\" alloy rims,\\n\\nIt also comes with the following features from the CREWMAX PLATINUM\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 2.5;**\\n\\n  * Dynamic radar cruise control,\\n  * Lane departure alert with steering assist,\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist,\\n  * Pre-Collision System,\\n  * Automatic high beams,\\n  * Right/Left Turn Oncoming Pedestrian Detection/Braking,\\n  * Left Turn Oncoming Vehicle Detection/Braking,\\n  * Sway Warning System\\n\\n**Off-road Performance;**\\n\\n  * Trailer Brakes,\\n  * Trailer Backup Guide with Straight Path Assist,\\n  * Active Noise Control,\\n  * Independent Front Suspension, Rear Coil Spring Suspension, \\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * JBL Premium audio,\\n  * Panoramic View Monitor,\\n  * Head-Up Display,\\n  * 14\\\" Touch-Screen,\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital Gauge cluster,\\n  * Full TFT LCD Gauge Cluster,\\n  * Wireless Charger,\\n  * Rain Sensing Wipers,\\n  * Trailer Backup Guide with Straight Path Assist,\\n  * Digital Display Rear View Mirror,\\n  * 120 Volt (400 Watt) Cargo Bed AC Power Outlet,\\n  * Smart Key System with Push Button Start,\\n  * Backup camera,\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto Compatibility,\\n  * SiriusXM radio,\\n  * Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n  * Power Tailgate\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Front Seat Massager,\\n  * Leather seats,\\n  * Power 10-Way Adjustable Driver & 8-Way Passenger Seats with 4-Way Adjustable Lumbar Support,\\n  * Power Tilt & Telescopic Steering Wheel,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Seasonal Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Ventilated front and rear seats,\\n  * Panoramic Sunroof,\\n  * Heated Front Seats,\\n  * Heated Leather-Wrapped Steering Wheel,\\n  * Dual Zone Automatic Climate Control with Air Conditioning,\\n  * Heated mir