ng\", \"AM/FM/satellite\", \"Wheel security locks\", \"Illuminated driver visor mirror\", \"Illuminated passenger visor mirror\", \"Heated driver and front passenger seats\", \"8 beverage holders\", \"Automatic climate control\", \"Yes\", \"Power door locks with 2 stage unlocking\", \"Smart key with hands-free access and push button start\", \"Low tire pressure warning\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"External exit warning system\", \"Leather steering wheel\", \"Heated steering wheel\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"First-row sliding and tilting glass sunroof with express open/close activation  sunshade\", \"Rear seat centre armrest\", \"Smart device remote start\", \"Push-button\", \"Independent rear suspension\", \"Rear lip spoiler\", \"Coloured bodyside insert\", \"Premium cloth front seat upholstery\", \"Metal-look door panel insert\", \"Premium cloth rear seat upholstery\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Variable intermittent front windshield wipers\", \"18 x 8-inch front and rear grey aluminum wheels\", \"P225/50VR18 AS BSW front and rear tires\", \"Multi-link rear suspension\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Sport front bucket seats\", \"Stainless steel single exhaust with chrome tailpipe finisher\", \"Body-coloured front bumper insert\", \"Black front bumper rub strip\", \"Sequential shift with steering wheel controls\", \"Driver seat with 8-way directional controls\", \"Driver seat with 2-way power lumbar\", \"Heated rear seats\", \"Cloth and leatherette front seat upholstery\", \"Leatherette front seatback upholstery\", \"Piano black and metal-look door panel insert\", \"Cloth and leatherette rear seat upholstery\", \"Cargo net\", \"Voice-activated climate control\", \"Branded speakers\", \"Amplifier\", \"Digital signal processor\", \"10.5 inch primary display\", \"Integrated navigation system with voice activation\", \"Turn-by-turn navigation system\", \"Real-time traffic\", \"Real-time weather\", \"Front wireles