, \"Trailer sway control\", \"Wheel security locks\", \"LEV3-SULEV30 emissions\", \"Tier 3 Bin 30 emissions\", \"10.5 inch primary display\", \"2 total number of 1st row displays\", \"3 month satellite trial subscription\", \"6 speakers\", \"AM/FM/satellite\", \"Auxiliary input jack\", \"External memory control\", \"Integrated roof audio antenna\", \"Primary monitor touchscreen\", \"Radio data system (RDS)\", \"Seek scan\", \"Speed sensitive volume\", \"Standard grade speakers\", \"Voice activated audio controls\", \"Wireless audio streaming\", \"120 month/240,000 km\", \"36 month/60,000 km\", \"36 month/unlimited\", \"60 month/100,000 km\", \"60 month/unlimited\", \"96 month/160,000 km\", \"2.5L I-4 DOHC\", \"2.5L I-4 port/direct injection, DOHC, variable valve control, regular unleaded, engine with 186HP\", \"240\", \"All-speed ABS and driveline traction control\", \"All-wheel drive\", \"Aluminum cylinder head\", \"Aluminum engine block\", \"Auto stop-start engine\", \"Automatic\", \"Automatic full-time AWD\", \"Battery run down protection\", \"CVT\", \"Driver selectable drivetrain mode\", \"ECO feedback display gauge\", \"Electric power-assist steering system\", \"Electronic parking brake\", \"Electronic transfer case shift\", \"Four channel ABS brakes\", \"Front anti-roll bar\", \"Front coil springs\", \"Front mounted engine\", \"Front ventilated disk brakes\", \"Gas-pressurized shock absorbers\", \"Hybrid\", \"Hybrid electric motor alternator\", \"Hybrid electric motor starter\", \"I4\", \"Independent front suspension\", \"Independent rear suspension\", \"Lead acid battery\", \"Lithium ion (Li-ion)\", \"Lock-up transmission\", \"Multi-link rear suspension\", \"Overdrive transmission\", \"PHEV (plug-in hybrid electric vehicle)\", \"Permanent locking hub control\", \"Rack-pinion steering\", \"Radiator\", \"Rear anti-roll bar\", \"Rear coil springs\", \"Regenerative brakes\", \"Regular Unleaded\", \"Regular grade rear springs\", \"Selectable mode transmission\", \"Sequential shift control\", \"Spark ignition system\", \"Speed sensitive power steering\", \"Sport ride suspension\", \"Stainless steel quasi-dual exhaust with chrome tailpipe finisher\", \"Strut front suspension\", \"Transmission electronic control\", \"Transmission oil cooler\", \"Transverse mounted engine\", \"2 seatbelt pre-tensioners\", \"4-wheel antilock (ABS) brakes\", \"4-wheel disk brakes\", \"8 airbags\", \"Airbag occupancy sensor\", \"Auto high-beam headlights\", \"Auto on/off headlight control\", \"Automatic brake hold\", \"Blind spot warning\", \"Configurable instrumentation gauges\", \"Curtain first and second-row overhead airbags\", \"Digital instrumentation display\", \"Driver front impact airbag\", \"Driver side knee airbag\", \"Electronic stability control system\", \"Evasion assist system\", \"External acoustic pedestrian alert\", \"External exit warning system\", \"Fade interior courtesy lights\", \"Following distance alert\", \"Forward collision mitigation with left turn assist\", \"Front height adjustable seatbelts\", \"Front passenger seat cushion airbag\", \"Front seatbelt pretensioners\", \"Gauge cluster display size: 12.30\", \"Hands-on cruise control\", \"Heated windshield wiper park\", \"High mounted centre stop light\", \"Hill start assist\", \"Illuminated entry\", \"Illuminated ignition switch\", \"Immobilizer\", \"LED brake lights\", \"LED daytime running lights\", \"LED low and high beam headlights\", \"Lane departure prevention\", \"Level 2 - partial automation SAE Autonomy\", \"Manual rear child safety door locks\", \"Multiple enclosed headlights\", \"Passenger front impact airbag\", \"Pedestrian impact prevention\", \"Predictive brake assist system\", \"Projector beam headlights\", \"Rain detecting wipers\", \"Rear collision warning\", \"Rear mounted camera\", \"Rear seat centre 3-point seatbelt\", \"Remote panic alarm\", \"Restricted driving mode/alerts\", \"Seat mounted side impact driver airbag\", \"Seat mounted side impact front passenger airbag\", \"Traffic sign recognition\", \"Turn signal indicator in door mirrors\", \"Vehicle tracker\", \"5 USB ports\", \"Handsfree wireless device connectivity\", \"Mobile app access\", \"Mobile hotspot internet access\", \"Smart device wireless mirroring\", \"Vehicle integrated emergency SOS system\"], \"is_loaner\": false, \"make_name\": \"Toyota\", \"video_url\": null, \"doors_name\": \"4\", \"in_transit\": true, \"is_decoded\": true, \"list_price\": 55998, \"model_name\": \"RAV4 Plug-In Hybrid\", \"passengers\": 5, \"sort_price\": 55998, \"stock_type\": \"NEW\", \"dealer_name\": \"Toyota on the Trail\", \"description\": \"**TOYOTA RAV4 SE AWD PLUG-IN HYBRID; SHOWROOM SPECIAL!! SUNROOF, SAFETY SENSE\\n4.0, HEATED SEATS/WHEEL, BACKUP CAMERA, REMOTE/SAFETY/SERVICE/DRIVE CONNECT,\\nAPPLE CARPLAY, ANDROID AUTO!!!**\\n\\nThe completely redesigned 2026 Toyota RAV4 Plug-in Hybrid SE AWD features\\nToyota\'s revolutionary 5th-generation hybrid system. Powered by a new 2.5L\\ndrivetrain, and 22.7 kWh battery. It delivers a smooth and confident 324 net\\nhorsepower through an eCVT to all four wheels, while achieving an impressive\\n2.4 Le/100 km combined fuel economy (89 km estimated electric driving range).\\nExceptionally well equipped, this RAV4 Plug-in Hybrid includes:\\n\\n**Includes;**\\n\\n  * TOTT+ Package\\n\\n**Toyota Safety Sense 4.0;**\\n\\n  * Automatic High Beam (AHB),\\n  * Road Sign Assist (RSA),\\n  * Proactive Driving Assist (PDA),\\n  * Pre-Collision System (PCS),\\n  * Lane Tracing Assist (LTA),\\n  * Dynamic Radar Cruise Control (DRCC),\\n  * Lane Departure Alert (LDA)\\n\\n**Technology;**\\n\\n  * Up to 7 kW Level 2 charging\\n  * 10.5\\\" Touchscreen with backup camera,\\n  * 12.3\\\" Digital cluster,\\n  * Smart key system with push button start,\\n  * Rain Sensing Wipers\\n  * Wireless Apple CarPlay and Wireless Android Auto,\\n  * 5G Connectivity with OTA Updates,\\n  * Sirius XM 360L (Satellite + Streaming content),\\n  * Dual Bluetooth and AM/FM/USB stereo,\\n  * J1772 Connector,\\n\\n**Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Dual-zone automatic climate control with air conditioning,\\n  * Power windows/locks/mirrors,\\n  * 8-Way Power Driver Seat with Lumbar Support,\\n  * Automatic headlights,\\n  * Leather Multi-function steering wheel,\\n\\n**Winter Comfort;**\\n\\n  * Heated front seats,\\n  * Heated Steering Wheel,\\n  * Windshield wiper deicer,\\n\\n**Remote + Service + Safety + Drive Connect;**\\n\\n  * Remote Connect (3 Year trial) - Engine Start/Stop, Door Lock/Unlock, Find My Vehicle, Guest Driver Monitor, Status of Windows.\\n  * Service Connect (Minimum 5-year trial) - Vehicle Health Reports, Warning Light Notifications, \\n  * Safety Connect (Minimum 5-year trial) - Automatic Collision Notification, Stolen Vehicle Locator, Emergency Assistance Button, Enhanced Roadside Assistance,\\n  * Drive Connect (Paid subscription required) - Cloud Navigation with real time traffic and Google POI, Destination Assist and enhanced Intelligent Assistant \\n\\n**Safety;**\\n\\n  * Intelligent Clearance Sonar,\\n  * Engine immobilizer,\\n  * Blindspot monitor with rear cross-traffic alert and safe exit alert,\\n  * Smart Stop Technology (SST),\\n  * Vehicle Stability Control (VSC),\\n  * Anti-lock Brake System (ABS),\\n  * Traction Control (TRAC),\\n  * Electronic Brake Force Distribution (EBD),\\n  * Brake Assist   (BA), \\n\\n**Exterior;**\\n\\n  * Power Sunroof,\\n  * 18\\\" Alloy Wheels,\\n  * LED Rear Combination Lamps,\\n  * LED Projector Low-and High-Beam Headlamps,\\n  * LED Daytime Running Lights (DRL),\\n\\nVisit Toyota on the Trail for the best 2026 Toyota RAV4 Plug-In Hybrid\\nEdmonton has to offer! Rugged on the outside, refined on the inside, and trail\\ntough throughout, Edmonton Toyota RAV4 Plug-In Hybrid drivers are making the\\nmost out of every moment. The newest RAV4 Plug-In Hybrid gives you added\\nconvenience, better comfort, next-level technology, and multi-terrain select.\\nThat\'s why this